            <div style="flex-grow: 1; background: #0c0c0c; border: 2px solid #222; border-radius: 8px; padding: 15px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; box-sizing: border-box; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);">
                <h3 style="margin: 0 0 12px 0; color: #b89047; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.85rem; letter-spacing: 1.5px; border-bottom: 1px solid #1f1f1f; padding-bottom: 6px; font-weight: bold;">🗃️ Bóveda de Archivos (.json)</h3>
