                                <span style="color: #ddd; font-weight: bold; font-family: sans-serif; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; max-width: 170px;">📜 @mazo.Replace("mazo_", "").Replace(".json", "").Replace("_", " ")</span>
                                <span style="font-size: 0.6rem; background: #261f18; color: #b89047; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 3px; border: 1px solid #423325; font-weight: bold;">DECK</span>
